<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><FONT face=Calibri>1).</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">高一年级</SPAN></B><st1:chmetcnv w:st="on" UnitName="米" SourceValue="30" HasSpace="False" Negative="False" NumberType="1" TCSC="0"><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><FONT face=Calibri>30</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">米</SPAN></B></st1:chmetcnv><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><FONT face=Calibri>*20</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">人迎面接力</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">——各班男女各</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><FONT face=Calibri>10</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">人（高一</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><FONT face=Calibri>4</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">班为</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><FONT face=Calibri>20</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">名男生，非第一名不录取名次），成对立面站位，以传接棒形式在最短时间内完成全程跑为胜。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><FONT face=Calibri>2).</FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">高二年级</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><FONT face=Calibri>1</FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">分钟跳长绳</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">——每班</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><FONT face=Calibri>12</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">名同学参赛，其中二人摇摆绳子，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><FONT face=Calibri>10</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">人（男女不限）跳长绳，规定时间内个数多者优胜，每班有二次机会取其中最优一次成绩。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><FONT face=Calibri>3).</FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">高三年级“开火车”</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><FONT face=Calibri>----</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">全程</SPAN><st1:chmetcnv w:st="on" UnitName="米" SourceValue="30" HasSpace="False" Negative="False" NumberType="1" TCSC="0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><FONT face=Calibri>30</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">米</SPAN></st1:chmetcnv><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">，男、女各</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><FONT face=Calibri>5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">人成一路纵队全蹲，后面同学双手依次搭在前面同学的肩膀上同步往前跳，途中断开取消名次，以排头到达终点为准计时，有两次机会，用时短者优胜，取最佳成绩录取名次。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">注：集体项目（不包括</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold"><FONT face=Calibri>4*100</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">接力）在男生人数不够的情况下班级女生可代替男生</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
