<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><FONT face=Calibri>1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">、本次运动会以“科学报国、筑梦青春”为主题<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">，</B></SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">入场式（分列式形式）进行评比<SPAN style="COLOR: black">（</SPAN></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">入场式各班指定一名同学拿班级牌</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">）</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">，评出最佳组织奖若干名；</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">同时进行<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">第三套中学生广播体操《舞动青春》比赛。</B>设一等奖、二等奖、三等奖。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">请各班写一份</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><FONT face=Calibri>100</FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">字的<SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">班级介绍词</SPAN></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri">，上交至德育处公共文件夹。</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: b