<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">7</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．赛场秩序（满分<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>分）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">非运动员和服务人员不准进入操场，班级服务人员进入赛场要以不影响运动员比赛为原则。影响比赛秩序者，视情节每人次扣<SPAN lang=EN-US>1-2</SPAN>分。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">运动员必须遵守赛场规则，服从裁判。对比赛成绩有异议者，凡运动员本人与裁判或工作人员发生争执的，将视情节每人次扣<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>－<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>分。<SPAN lang=EN-US> <o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">8</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．闭幕式（满分<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>分）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">各班组织学生参加闭幕式，并做到队伍迅速、整齐、安静、服从指挥。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">9</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．教室秩序（满分<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>分）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">高一、高二学生不准无故进入教室，离开教室后关好门窗；高三非运动员在教室安静自修。以上出现违纪现象每人次扣<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>分。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">10</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．其它事项（<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>分）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">    </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">注意财物、运动安全，教室、场地没有事故，得<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>分，如出现安全事故，该项目不得分；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">好人好事，有良好精神风貌的事件出现，每次加<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>分，最高加<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>分。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">二、 评比与设奖办法<SPAN lang=EN-US> </SPAN></SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．由校德育处、团委负责，各班派干部<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>名，组成评比小组，年段交叉评比，每半天负责打分一次。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．根据各班级所得总分情况，由高分到低分评出年段优秀组织奖，高一：一等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>个，二等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>名，三等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>名；高二：一等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>个，二等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>名，三等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>名；高三：一等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>个，二等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>名，三等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>名。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">设立入场式比赛高一：一等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>名，二等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>名，三等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>名；高二：一等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>个，二等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>名，三等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>名；高三：一等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>名，二等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>名，三等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>名。担任仪仗队的班级不参与入场式奖评定，学校将单独设立“特别贡献奖”。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">设立《舞动青春》广播操比赛高一：一等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>名，二等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>名，三等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>名；高二：一等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>个，二等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>名，三等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>名；高三：一等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>名，二等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>名，三等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>名。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">5</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．另外单独设立高一、高二宣传报道奖（每个年段<SPAN lang=EN-US>7</SPAN>名）和优秀啦啦队（每个年段<SPAN lang=EN-US>7</SPAN>支）</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-font-width: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体"><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
